})();</script></div></div></div><div class="KLEmSd"></div><div data-encoded-docid="T-eetaF-4AL6IxetAAAAAA==" data-implicit-notification-eligible="false" data-result-index="0" data-title="Senior Data Analyst - AI &amp; Automation" role="group" jscontroller="leJiCf" jsdata="ZSBYQe;_;9fn4aqWXNZea4-EP7--hgAw42 xQKg9c;_;9fn4aqWXNZea4-EP7--hgAw43" jsaction="rcuQ6b:npT2md"><div><div class="XFOJCe"><h2 class="HKvozf IFnjPb">Job description</h2><span jsname="QAWWu" class="OOyDTc">About the RoleWe are looking for an innovative Data Analyst with AI Experience to bridge traditional data analysis with modern AI-driven automation. You will manage large datasets, build insightful dashboards, and leverage cutting-edge AI and scripting tools to fundamentally transform how data workflows operate within a Google-integrated ecosystem.Key ResponsibilitiesData Analysis &amp; Dashboards: Pr</span><span jsname="pqRzIf">...</span><span jsname="ij8cu" class="ejCXj" id="tsuid_9fn4aqWXNZea4-EP7--hgAw_143" aria-live="polite" style="display:none">ocess complex datasets using SQL, Python, and Google Sheets, and build interactive reports using Tableau, Power BI, or Looker Studio.AI-First Automation &amp; MCP Integration: Design and deploy Model Context Protocol (MCP) standards and LLM integrations to allow AI agents to safely connect with enterprise data sources and execute multi-step workflows.Advanced Scripting: Build robust data pipelines and complex automations using Python, and streamline day-to-day operations using JavaScript and Google Apps Script across Google Workspace.ETL &amp; Data Governance: Manage basic ETL frameworks, data validation, reconciliation, and consistency across platforms.Stakeholder Collaboration: Translate complex technical findings into clear insights using Google Slides or PowerPoint for cross-functional teams.Candidate RequirementsCore Technical SkillsExperience: 5 to 8+ years of professional experience in a data analysis, business intelligence, or data-driven role.Programming &amp; Databases: Solid foundation in Python and SQL / Google SQL for data extraction, manipulation, and pipeline creation.Google Ecosystem &amp; AI Tooling: Hands-on experience with Google Sheets, Looker Studio, Gemini models, and LLM APIs, alongside workflow automation via JavaScript / Google Apps Script.Modern Frameworks: Familiarity with Model Context Protocol (MCP) standards for dynamic context sharing and tool orchestration.BI &amp; Visualization: Expertise in data visualization platforms like Tableau, Power BI, or Looker Studio.Soft Skills &amp; MindsetAnalytical Thinking: Naturally curious with high attention to detail and a passion for independent problem-solving.Communication: Excellent verbal and written communication skills to convey findings effectively to technical and non-technical stakeholders.</span></div><div jsname="G7vtgf" class="TOQyFc Uzkg7d MmMIvd brKmxb" aria-controls="tsuid_9fn4aqWXNZea4-EP7--hgAw_143" role="button" tabindex="0" jsaction="EMtXr" data-l="" data-hveid="CCsQTg" data-ved="2ahUKEwjl5d-g2YiYAxUXzTgGHe93CMAQl5ACegQIKxBO"><hr class="Bi9oQd" aria-hidden="true"><div class="Wjtive btku5b rXoM2c sjVJQd"><div class="niO4u VDgVie SlP8xc"><span class="cHaqb"><span class="PBBEhf">Show full description</span></span><span class="T2xY9b w2fKdd z1asCe" aria-hidden="true" style="height:18px;line-height:18px;width:18px"><svg focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960"><path d="M480-344L240-584l56-56L480-456L664-640l56,56L480-344Z"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="XFOJCe" data-ved="2ahUKEwjl5d-g2YiYAxUXzTgGHe93CMAQ5ZkFegQIKxBP"><div class="EyBRub" data-ved="2ahUKEwjl5d-g2YiYAxUXzTgGHe93CMAQyo8CegQIKxBQ"><div jscontroller="Wo3n8" jsname="aadvhe" jsmodel=" d5EhJe" data-bkt="horizon_jobs" data-fhs="" data-maindata='[null,null,"bind(&#39;java/com/google/gws/plugins/horizon/jobs/viewer/herocontent/jslayout/feedback_messages.html#JobAtEmployer&#39;,{employer_name